  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Term insurance kitne ka cover lena chahiye?",
      "a": "Ek thumb rule hai ki apki current annual income ka 15-20 times cover hona chahiye. For example, if earning ₹10 Lakh/year, ₹1.5 Cr se ₹2 Cr cover is ideal."
    },
    {
      "q": "Meri company ka health insurance hai, do I need personal cover?",
      "a": "Yes. Corporate cover job chhodte hi khatam ho jata hai. Old age me naya plan milna mushkil aur expensive hota hai. Personal base plan zaroori hai."
    },
    {
      "q": "Claim reject hone ke chances kitne hain?",
      "a": "Agar aap policy lete waqt apni medical history honestly disclose karte hain, toh claim reject nahi hota. Hum proposal form fill karne me apki madad karte hain."
    },
    {
      "q": "Kya aap claim settlement me help karte ho?",
      "a": "Absolutely! Humara USP hi claim support hai. From arranging documents to coordinating with TPAs, hum poora process handhold karte hain."
    }
  ],
